<title>UK: Morrison places 9.6 mln shares at 275p/share.</title>
<headline>Morrison places 9.6 mln shares at 275p/share.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Construction Group Plc said on Tuesday certain directors and senior executives have placed around 9.6 million shares with institutional investors at 275 pence per share.</p>
<p>The placing represents around 14 percent of the company's issued share capital.</p>
</text>
